{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:53 2026-10-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:53 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:53 2026-10-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"今日升幅王｜抗癌新藥試驗報捷 Genmab股價飆兩成 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/5bab8ae7da8d45e7148b73fc21d9491f/2026-10/bioreactor_laboratory_1200x675.jpg\"/><p>生物科技公司Genmab（GMAB）公布旗下實驗性抗癌藥物Petosemtamab第三期臨床試驗取得正面結果，該藥物聯合默沙東旗下癌症免疫治療藥物，可將部分頭頸癌患者的死亡風險降低50%。</p><p>Genmab計劃與全球各地監管機構溝通，並於未來的醫學會議公布完整試驗數據。受消息刺激，Genmab盤中股價急升25%，股價創歷史新高。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:01:12.321055+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:53:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:35.670115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:33.062602+00:00","content_hash":"8a5e624bca634b1131733d90347ee3c00afbb831934da6ba71ec8e1b1900369f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}